{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/44429559aa722e8f3bafad0dedc9a230.poster.avif?t=1767447890\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/44429559aa722e8f3bafad0dedc9a230.webm?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/44429559aa722e8f3bafad0dedc9a230.mp4?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>&quot;Have we all been acting waywardly?&quot;</strong></i><br><br>Break Wolf is an Adventure RPG that deals with the life and death of wayward humans,<br>striving to escape a syndicate that creates monsters.<br><br>You can choose to kill or save them,<br>and depending on who survives, the story and combat style change.<br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/6f7b6318e7981f5780b61de4d561b809.poster.avif?t=1767447890\" width=550 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/6f7b6318e7981f5780b61de4d561b809.webm?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><i>A psychological story focusing on the rough, imperfect psyches of Romit and his companions, <br>who are attempting to escape from a syndicate that creates monsters.</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/bde522ab8bcef214322c7d8718fecaa8.poster.avif?t=1767447890\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/bde522ab8bcef214322c7d8718fecaa8.webm?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/bde522ab8bcef214322c7d8718fecaa8.mp4?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Romit, faced with disposal due to underperformance,<br>finds himself at a crossroads between life and death without a choice.<br>However, Healer Amoria, responsible for treating the monsters,<br>feels a sense of kinship with him and decides to help him escape.<br><br>As they make their escape, they encounter both allies and obstacles.<br>What thoughts and decisions will Romit make as he confronts them?<br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/727906b53235e66226a1779beb4dd430.poster.avif?t=1767447890\" width=550 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/727906b53235e66226a1779beb4dd430.webm?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>A turn-based RPG with elements of an adventure game, <br>featuring various interactions and skill-equipment combinations.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/c7b75275f0196a499ae38b0eaa0d8d4e.poster.avif?t=1767447890\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/c7b75275f0196a499ae38b0eaa0d8d4e.webm?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144190/extras/c7b75275f0196a499ae38b0eaa0d8d4e.mp4?t=1767447890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Detailed i